    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_090"
    },
    {
        "text": "Confirm all comms! For the time being, no casualties!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_088"
    },
    {
        "text": "Calm your hustle. Those mercs haven't gone far. They're confirming the situation, prying for opportunities...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Command tower got caught up in a sudden explosion at the top, and now it's fallen into... momentary peace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_sp_ballista"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_090"
    },
    {
        "text": "What part of this screams peace to you?! A\u2014Amiya's group are okay, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_088"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm... well, with that going on at the tower top, I'd say we're practically the picture of peace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_sp_ballista"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "F... finally\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't drop your guard, we're still\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "W\u2014why'd you go mute? Hello\u2014?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's so interesting about the sky? Is something going on at the tower...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Wait, i\u2014is that an... orb of light? A ball... a ball of fire? A halo? What IS that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_088"
    },
    {
        "text": "Arts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Arts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_090"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah! I've been making a record. Since the start, that first huge sound, the flames and heated airstreams have burst through the building's dome. From beneath the tower, to the naked eye, it looks like...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like the afterglow of the setting sun."
    },
    {
        "text": "Like the death of Infected as successive as the waves."
    },
    {
        "text": "Like rage."
    },
    {
        "text": "Like this city placed in ruin."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I don't think I'm particularly perceptive compared to the rest of you, but I know more or less what you want to say here, really.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_088"
    },
    {
        "text": "That'd be the leader of Reunion's...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heat and flame.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "But heat and flame... shouldn't be things so fearful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_088"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm. That ball of light. That's one... two people's. No, perhaps even more than that, even more rage...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "So that's... Talulah?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_088"
    },
    {
        "text": "It isn't. Or put another way, it's not just her. Not by far. Everyone knows the leader of Reunion as the intel described her, but I can't draw a line between that young little dragon and what I'm seeing now at all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_090"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just what... just what happened up there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_088"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I don't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_090"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
