    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is there anyone else in the command tower?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_090"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then we need to go help them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait! Keep your head down!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Enemies have left the command tower! Go find them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Block this place off. Don't give them the chance to seek aid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_sp_ballista"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fireburst",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$firestorm",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_090"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh\u2014what do we do now?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe we should go back and help Amiya\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_088"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only Amiya... Only Amiya can do this. She can. I'm sure of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "I believe in her. That's the only reason I have for standing here now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "And...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "And she promised me. On my next paid leave, she'd tag along with me to hit the streets... and no leader's allowed to eat their words.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then until Amiya comes back clutching victory, we can't relinquish the control tower. At the very least, we hold on until Dr. Kal'tsit arrives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "We\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
