    },
    {
        "text": "C-Could a sword do this?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_088"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'll hold the mercs off outside the control tower. You guys, back in. Rescue the remaining people. Secure an evacuation route that hasn't been destroyed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "How are you gonna hold alone against that many Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll go with her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "You guys, go back in now. Move.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Rhodes doesn't have many left. Tell the other teams to haul the net in. We'll be going this way...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Crash their defensive line ASAP. Their deaths will be our greatest bargaining chips.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "Move!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Alright!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_090"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you push it now! They've got a lot of people!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_088"
    },
    {
        "text": "...It's been forever. Us two, fighting side by side, eyeing for a chance to ambush the enemy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The two battle-hardened Operators hold tight their weapons in mutual rapport, and the Sarkazs' press on towards them menacingly."
    },
    {
        "text": "Neither side takes their eyes off the other."
    },
    {
